Third-party software that this repository does not contain
----------------------------------------------------------

The build links Microsoft's Azure Kinect Sensor SDK (libk4a, libk4arecord). The
Sensor SDK's source code is under the MIT licence quoted above. At run time
libk4a loads the depth engine (libdepthengine). The depth engine is a
proprietary Microsoft binary under the Microsoft Software License Terms that
come with it. You install them separately; this repository contains no part of
them.

The Python wheel
----------------

The Python wheel xblick-azure-kinect also contains software of others. Their
licence texts are in the directory licenses/, which the wheel carries in its
metadata (xblick_azure_kinect-<version>.dist-info/licenses/licenses/).

- xblick_azure_kinect/lib/libk4a.so.1.4, libk4arecord.so.1.4: Microsoft's Azure
  Kinect Sensor SDK v1.4.2, built from its source code by tools/build_wheel.sh,
  under the MIT licence quoted above (licenses/Azure-Kinect-Sensor-SDK-LICENSE).
  Not Microsoft's prebuilt libraries. licenses/k4a-sdk-sources.txt names the
  SDK's commit and the commit of every git submodule the build used. The two
  libraries contain code of these submodules, each under its own licence:
  - azure-c-shared-utility (MIT): licenses/azure-c-shared-utility-LICENSE
  - cJSON (MIT): licenses/cJSON-LICENSE
  - libjpeg-turbo (IJG License, Modified BSD License, zlib License). This
    software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group:
    licenses/k4a-libjpeg-turbo-LICENSE.md, licenses/k4a-libjpeg-turbo-README.ijg
  - libusb (GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1): licenses/libusb-COPYING
  - libuvc, Microsoft's fork (BSD): licenses/libuvc-LICENSE.txt
  - libyuv (BSD): licenses/libyuv-LICENSE, licenses/libyuv-PATENTS
  - libebml and libmatroska (GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1):
    licenses/libebml-LICENSE.LGPL, licenses/libmatroska-LICENSE.LGPL
  - spdlog (MIT) with fmt (MIT): licenses/spdlog-LICENSE, licenses/fmt-LICENSE.rst
  The complete source code of libusb, libebml and libmatroska as built, with
  the SDK's CMake files that build them, is the archive
  xblick-azure-kinect-<version>-lgpl-sources.tar.gz attached to each GitHub
  release of the wheel (https://github.com/xblick/xblick-azure-kinect/releases).
  It is also at the commits that licenses/k4a-sdk-sources.txt names, in their
  repositories (https://github.com/libusb/libusb,
  https://github.com/Matroska-Org/libebml,
  https://github.com/Matroska-Org/libmatroska). libk4a.so.1.4 and libk4arecord.so.1.4 are separate files of the
  wheel: they can be replaced by a build of a modified version of these
  libraries.

- xblick_azure_kinect/lib/libzenohc.so: Eclipse zenoh-c 1.10.1
  (https://github.com/eclipse-zenoh/zenoh-c), built from its source by
  tools/build_wheel.sh. Eclipse zenoh-c is made available under the terms of
  the Eclipse Public License 2.0 or the Apache License, Version 2.0
  (SPDX-License-Identifier: EPL-2.0 OR Apache-2.0). Its licence and notice:
