  https://crates.io/crates/option-ext/0.2.0.

- The programs contain nlohmann_json 3.12.0 (https://github.com/nlohmann/json,
  MIT): licenses/nlohmann-json-LICENSE.MIT.

- xblick_azure_kinect.libs/ (libjpeg): libjpeg-turbo 1.5.3 as packaged by
  AlmaLinux 8, added to the wheel by auditwheel. This software is based in part
  on the work of the Independent JPEG Group. libjpeg-turbo is covered by the
