The wheel does not contain the depth engine (libdepthengine) or any file of
NVIDIA. Its setup command xblick-azure-kinect-setup downloads Microsoft's
package on the user's PC once the user accepts Microsoft's terms; nvJPEG and
the CUDA runtime are NVIDIA's PyPI packages, which the wheel depends on. The
CUDA module's kernel is this repository's code (src/gpu_rectify.cu), compiled
with NVIDIA's nvcc.
